== 2. two applies in the same second, then rollback twice

$ mandrake link apply   # rules -> a
  links: backuplink  rules -> $T/a
  journal $T/mh/state/journal/20261025-011110.json

$ mandrake link apply   # rules -> b, same second
  links: relink      rules -> $T/b
  journal $T/mh/state/journal/20261025-011110.json

$ ls state/journal
  20261025-011110.json

$ mandrake link rollback
  rolled back 1 steps

$ mandrake link rollback
  Error: no journal to roll back in $T/mh/state/journal

$ readlink ~/.claude/rules || ls ~/.claude/rules
  link -> $T/a

verdict: BUG 1 journal(s) for two applies; the original folder is not back
